  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-05-09T21:03:35.774Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Standard has both Roughness Metallic and Albedo Alpha settings\n\nWhy doesn't Mobile Standard Lite have it?\n\nI have to create metallic maps just to have a Roughness map and that takes more space\n\nIt would be way more memory optimized to have a Roughness Albedo Alpha option",
